<title>USA: Input/Output Inc says Selecman is new CEO.</title>
<headline>Input/Output Inc says Selecman is new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>STAFFORD, Texas 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Input/Output Inc said on Friday that its chairman, Charles Selecman, had been elected to the additional responsibilities of president and chief executive officer of the company, succeeding Gary Owens.</p>
<p>The company said that Owens had resigned from his post, and that Selecman would take over his new responsibilities immediately.</p>
<p>Selecman, 68, served as the company's president and chief executive from 1989 to 1993, the company said.</p>
<p>Input/Output Inc designs and manufactures seismic systems and related equipment.</p>
</text>
